-- Glossary:
--   Glassmorphism — UI style using translucent "frosted glass" surfaces.
--   Drift — slow continuous animation of gradient rotation/offset.
--   FAB — Floating Action Button (circular, bottom-right, prominent).
--   FOV — Field of View (common aimbot slider setting).
--   ESP — Extra Sensory Perception (wallhack-style visual overlays).
--   Palette — a named set of {From, To, Accent, Glow, TextOn} colors.
--   Toast — transient notification popup.
--   UIScale — Roblox object that scales an entire ScreenGui uniformly.
--   RenderStepped — per-frame event used for smooth animations.
--   Tween — Roblox's built-in interpolation service (TweenService).

